%% 05-alignment.mgp - learn MagicPoint on gucOS, deck 5 of 10 (todos/0202).
%% Justification (%left/%center/%right/%leftfill) and drawing areas (%area).
%deffont "standard" tfont "/usr/share/fonts/mono.ttf"
%default 1 area 90 90, size 2, fore "white", back "DarkGreen", font "standard"
%default 2 size 9, vgap 20, prefix " ", center
%default 3 size 5, fore "yellow", vgap 30
%tab 1 size 4, vgap 40, prefix "  ", icon box "gold" 50, left
%tab 2 size 3, vgap 40, prefix "      ", icon arc "gold" 50, left
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Alignment

deck 5 of 10: justification and areas
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Four justifications

%size 5, fore "white"
%left
left hugs this edge
%center
center splits the difference
%right
right hugs that edge
%size 4, fore "gray70", center

each takes effect for the lines after it -
titles center, body usually goes left
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

\%leftfill - paragraphs

%size 4, fore "white", leftfill
plain left CLIPS a long line at the page edge, but leftfill left-justifies AND folds it onto the next line, which is what this running sentence is demonstrating right now.
%size 4, fore "gray70", left

use leftfill for prose, left for everything else
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

\%area - the canvas

%size 4, fore "white", center
directives place text inside a DRAWING AREA;
the deck default here is area 90 90 (centered)
%area 45 45 50 45
%size 5, fore "gold", leftfill
area 45 45 50 45 confines drawing to a box 45% wide and 45% tall, whose corner sits at 50 45.
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Areas re-scale sizes

	after %area, all relative units follow the AREA
		size 5 inside a half-width area is smaller
	omit the offsets and the area centers itself
	the page resets to the deck default area
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Layout recipes

	title page: everything centered
	body page: centered title, left bullets
	quote page: leftfill inside a narrow area
%pause
%size 4, center, fore "gold"

alignment is rhythm - pick one recipe per deck
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

The end

%size 4, center
next: 06-lists.mgp
